      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니~\n상태 이상은 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>독<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이 최고라니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8007E000AC0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C740002000100002FF000006B3C500100002FF000000C7740020CD5CACE0B77CB2C8AE4C0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "HP를 점점 줄여서\n테크니컬하게 승리할 수 있다구!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480050B97C0020C810C8100020C904C5ECC11C000AD14CD06CB2C8CEECD558AC8C0020C2B9B9ACD5600020C2180020C788B2E4AD6C0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니요!\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>마비<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>야말로 최고의 상태 이상이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8C6940021000A00100002FF000006B9C8BE4400100002FF000000C57CB9D0B85C0020CD5CACE0C7580020C0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C774C5D0C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마비된 포켓몬은\n이동 속도가 느려지게 돼요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8BE44B41C0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AC774B3D90020C18DB3C4AC000020B290B824C9C0AC8C0020B3FCC6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "굼뜨게 움직이는 상대를 단숨에 공격해\n엘레강스하게 승리할 수 있다구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD7CB728AC8C0020C6C0C9C1C774B2940020C0C1B300B97C0020B2E8C228C5D00020ACF5ACA9D574000AC5D8B808AC15C2A4D558AC8C0020C2B9B9ACD5600020C2180020C788B2E4AD6CC6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거기 지나가던 당신!\n마침 잘 왔어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE300020C9C0B098AC00B3580020B2F9C2E00021000AB9C8CE680020C7980020C654C5B40021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독과 마비!\n어느 쪽이 더 대단한지 확인하게 해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C5ACFC0020B9C8BE440021000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020B3540020B300B2E8D55CC9C00020D655C778D558AC8C0020D5740020C918002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "즉, 포켓몬 승부를 하자는 거예요!\n우선 저부터 상대해 보시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C989002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558C790B2940020AC70C608C6940021000AC6B0C1200020C800BD80D1300020C0C1B300D5740020BCF4C2DCC8E00021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독과 마비!\n어느 쪽이 더 대단한지 확인하게 해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C5ACFC0020B9C8BE440021000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020B3540020B300B2E8D55CC9C00020D655C778D558AC8C0020D5740020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우선 제 마비 전법을 상대해 보시죠!\n자, 시작할까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C1200020C81C0020B9C8BE440020C804BC95C7440020C0C1B300D5740020BCF4C2DCC8E00021000AC790002C0020C2DCC791D560AE4CC694003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시작해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC791D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마비 전법을 상대할 생각만 해도\n오금이 저리시나 보죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8BE440020C804BC95C7440020C0C1B300D5600020C0DDAC01B9CC0020D574B3C4000AC624AE08C7740020C800B9ACC2DCB0980020BCF4C8E0003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마비된 포켓몬은\n이동 속도가 느려지게 돼요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8BE44B41C0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AC774B3D90020C18DB3C4AC000020B290B824C9C0AC8C0020B3FCC6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "몸이 마음대로 잘 안 움직이는 사이에\n단숨에 공격을 퍼부어 끝내 드리겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAB8C7740020B9C8C74CB300B85C0020C7980020C5480020C6C0C9C1C774B2940020C0ACC774C5D0000AB2E8C228C5D00020ACF5ACA9C7440020D37CBD80C5B40020B05DB0B40020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독 전법이야말로 최강의 전법이지만\n포켓몬 승부의 순서는 양보하겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C50020C804BC95C774C57CB9D0B85C0020CD5CAC15C7580020C804BC95C774C9C0B9CC000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C7580020C21CC11CB2940020C591BCF4D558ACA0C5B4002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 완패로군요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020C644D328B85CAD70C694002E002E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아 참! 마비 상태는\n승부가 끝나도 치료되지 않아요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5440020CC3800210020B9C8BE440020C0C1D0DCB294000AC2B9BD80AC000020B05DB098B3C40020CE58B8CCB418C9C00020C54AC544C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 포켓몬이 마비에 걸리면\n마비치료제로 치료해 주도록 하세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B9C8BE44C5D00020AC78B9ACBA74000AB9C8BE44CE58B8CCC81CB85C0020CE58B8CCD5740020C8FCB3C4B85D0020D558C138C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마비 전법을 돌파하다니,\n꽤 하나 보네.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8BE440020C804BC95C7440020B3CCD30CD558B2E4B2C8002C000AAF640020D558B0980020BCF4B124002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은 내 차례야!\n독으로 HP를 서서히 깎아 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC7400020B0B40020CC28B840C57C0021000AB3C5C73CB85C002000480050B97C0020C11CC11CD7880020AE4EC5440020C8FCACA0C5B40021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번엔 독이야!\n포켓몬 승부를 할 준비는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D40020B3C5C774C57C0021000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5600020C900BE44B2940020B410C5B4003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독 전법의 무시무시함을 눈치채고\n겁에 질렸나 보구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C50020C804BC95C7580020BB34C2DCBB34C2DCD568C7440020B208CE58CC44ACE0000AAC81C5D00020C9C8B838B0980020BCF4AD6CB0980021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독 상태가 된 포켓몬은\n계속해서 데미지를 입게 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C50020C0C1D0DCAC000020B41C0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AACC4C18DD574C11C0020B370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C785AC8C0020B3FC002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 공포를...\n똑똑히 맛보게 해 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020ACF5D3ECB97C002E002E002E000AB611B611D7880020B9DBBCF4AC8C0020D5740020C8FCACA0C5B40021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이 마비에 걸렸다면\n마비치료제로 치료해 주도록 하세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B9C8BE44C5D00020AC78B838B2E4BA74000AB9C8BE44CE58B8CCC81CB85C0020CE58B8CCD5740020C8FCB3C4B85D0020D558C138C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바미가 진 건 그렇다 쳐도\n나까지 질 줄이야...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14BBF8AC000020C9C40020AC740020ADF8B807B2E40020CCD0B3C4000AB098AE4CC9C00020C9C80020C904C774C57C002E002E002E0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신, 솔직히 말해 봐.\n독과 마비 중에 어느 쪽이 더 어려웠어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0002C0020C194C9C1D7880020B9D0D5740020BD10002E000AB3C5ACFC0020B9C8BE440020C911C5D00020C5B4B2900020CABDC7740020B3540020C5B4B824C6E0C5B4003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마비!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8BE4400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "둘 다 아무렇지 않았어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4580020B2E40020C544BB34B807C9C00020C54AC558C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐라고!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50B77CACE00021003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거 보시라구요!\n역시 마비에 쩔쩔매셨다잖아요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC700020BCF4C2DCB77CAD6CC6940021000AC5EDC2DC0020B9C8BE44C5D00020CA54CA54B9E4C168B2E4C796C544C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래!? 역시 그렇지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7980021003F0020C5EDC2DC0020ADF8B807C9C0003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기요!\n마비도 독 못지않다구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30C6940021000AB9C8BE44B3C40020B3C50020BABBC9C0C54AB2E4AD6CC6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 뭐야!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020BB50C57C0021003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상태 이상 따위\n식은 죽 먹기라는 건가요!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1D0DC0020C774C0C10020B530C704000AC2DDC7400020C8FD0020BA39AE30B77CB2940020AC74AC00C6940021003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 두옥 씨도\n이기지 못한 건 매한가지지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020B450C6250020C528B3C4000AC774AE30C9C00020BABBD55C0020AC740020B9E4D55CAC00C9C0C9C0B9CCC694002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리도 아직 갈 길이 멀구나...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACB3C40020C544C9C10020AC080020AE38C7740020BA40AD6CB098002E002E002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상태 이상은 이외에도 많아...\n변화무쌍한 기술을 다듬어 나가야겠지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C7400020C774C678C5D0B3C40020B9CEC544002E002E002E000ABCC0D654BB34C30DD55C0020AE30C220C7440020B2E4B4ECC5B40020B098AC00C57CACA0C9C00021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 포켓몬 말인데요.\n상태 이상이 아직 남아 있다면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이 만병통치제로 치료해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAAC0020B9D0C778B370C694002E000AC0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C7740020C544C9C10020B0A8C5440020C788B2E4BA7400100001BE00000AC7740020B9CCBCD1D1B5CE58C81CB85C0020CE58B8CCD5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상태 이상이 전부 회복되는\n저희의 필수품이랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C7740020C804BD800020D68CBCF5B418B294000AC800D76CC7580020D544C218D488C774B78DB2C8B2E40021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이 힘들어하지 않도록\n상태 이상은 바로 치료하는 게 중요해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7740020D798B4E4C5B4D558C9C00020C54AB3C4B85D000AC0C1D0DC0020C774C0C1C7400020BC14B85C0020CE58B8CCD558B2940020AC8C0020C911C694D574C6940021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기억해 두도록 하세요,\n지나가던 트레이너님!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
